<title>USA: Sigma-Aldrich finalizes German partnership.</title>
<headline>Sigma-Aldrich finalizes German partnership.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sigma-Aldrich Corp, a chemical developer, said Monday it has finalized a laboratory chemicals partnership in Germany with AlliedSignal Inc, an advanced technology and manufacturing company.</p>
<p>Sigma-Aldrich will own 75 percent of the partnership, known as RdH Laborchemikalien GmbH &amp; Co, while AlliedSignal will own the other 25 percent, Sigma-Aldrich said.</p>
<p>The partnership sells more than 6,000 laboratory chemicals, the company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
